WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.480
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a German comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Suck Me Shakespeer.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:22.960
Zeki Müller is a felon serving prison time for&nbsp;
robbing a bank. He attends an academic class in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.920
prison where the inmates are provided different&nbsp;
levels of education. On evaluating Zeki’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.960
knowledge, the teacher discovers that he is dumber&nbsp;
than a middle schooler. She thinks he should be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:38.240
locked away from society because of his lack of&nbsp;
general knowledge. But against her wish, Zeki is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:44.160
being released that day. He walks out of prison&nbsp;
with a trashy phone and a few pennies to start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:50.080
a new life. But he is not worried at all. 
It turns out that he had stolen a million euros&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:55.280
right before going to prison. His friend Zeynep&nbsp;
takes him to the place where she has buried the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:01.120
money and gives him the coordinates of the exact&nbsp;
spot. To Zeki’s surprise, a school’s gymnasium has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.080
been built over his money. He is distressed&nbsp;
but determined to get the money back. 
&nbsp;

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.480
In the following scene, a gangster&nbsp;
bangs Zeki’s dead onto a table,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:14.960
asking for two thousand euros worth of loan&nbsp;
that he had borrowed before imprisonment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.240
Zeki promises to get the money back in a few&nbsp;
weeks and in turn asks for accommodation. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:25.520
gangster owns a strip club and allows him to&nbsp;
crash in one of the display rooms. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.520
Zeki decides to get a job as a&nbsp;
janitor in the school. That way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.680
he can gain access to the gymnasium and&nbsp;
can build a tunnel up to his money. 
&nbsp;

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:38.800
The following day, he goes to the school for an&nbsp;
interview and bumps into a teacher named Lisi.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.160
She has a cheerful personality, a trait that her&nbsp;
students either love or hate. Zeki goes to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:48.160
principal’s office and sees a bunch of people&nbsp;
waiting for a job interview. Although they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:53.360
are overly dressed for a janitor, Zeki doesn’t&nbsp;
think much of it. To get rid of the competition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:58.000
he breaks the fire alarm, making everyone&nbsp;
run away. When the principal comes outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.040
he tells her a student broke it accidentally.&nbsp;
Zeki soon finds out that the principal thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.080
he is there to apply for the job of a substitute&nbsp;
teacher. He tries explaining otherwise but she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.880
doesn’t give him a chance. When Zeki finds out&nbsp;
that the teachers get a spare key to the gym&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.680
and a salary of two thousand euros,&nbsp;
he cannot let the opportunity go. 
&nbsp;

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:22.080
Now, the only problem is his academic&nbsp;
qualifications that he needs to hand in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:28.000
the next day. Outside the school, Lisi is trying&nbsp;
to stop a student who is smoking. Zeki helps her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.400
and asks her for a favor. He pretends to&nbsp;
be interested in sharing the syllabus but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:37.360
in reality, wants to steal her academic&nbsp;
certification to use it as his own. 
&nbsp;

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:43.120
Later that day, they meet at her house and share&nbsp;
an awkward conversation. When she is distracted,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:48.880
Zeki drugs her cup of tea that makes her pass&nbsp;
out. Taking the opportunity, he searches the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:54.400
entire house for her academic certification and&nbsp;
tries to print it. But just when he is in a hurry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.400 --> 00:03:00.720
the printer refuses to work. So instead, Zeki&nbsp;
transfers the file to a flash drive. Lisi’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:06.480
friend Caro arrives home and is about to catch him&nbsp;
in the act. Zeki makes it seem like he and Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:11.440
are in bed together and covers up his plan. 
The following morning, they bump into each other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:16.560
at school but Zeki doesn’t acknowledge what&nbsp;
happened yesterday. Lisi is bothered because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:20.000
to her, they had gotten a bit too&nbsp;
close than they should have. 
&nbsp;

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.800
Zeki walks into the teacher’s room right before&nbsp;
a teacher jumps off the window. She had been so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.518
troubled by the students of her class that&nbsp;
she decided to end her own life. Thankfully,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.518 --> 00:03:29.280
she survives the fall and is taken to the&nbsp;
hospital. But now, in her place, Lisi is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:34.480
assigned to class 10 B. The students of the class&nbsp;
are known as the devils in disguise. They play&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:40.160
seemingly harmless pranks on the teachers and make&nbsp;
their life a living hell. Suffice to say that Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.880
is not too thrilled about the assignment. 
In his first class, Zeki orders the students to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:50.400
bring a VCD of their favorite movie every day for&nbsp;
them to watch in his class. The one who chooses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.600
the best movie will get better grades. Zeki seems&nbsp;
to be enjoying teaching but the same cannot be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.960
said for Lisi. The students laugh at every word&nbsp;
she says and do not cooperate. When she picks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:06.880
up chalk, a slimy substance sticks it to her&nbsp;
fingers. Then, as she tries to wash it off, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:12.560
faucet breaks. She realizes the student had set&nbsp;
up the prank and dries herself off with a towel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:18.560
only to find out that it has been smothered with&nbsp;
a black substance. Humiliated, she tries to leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:27.520
but the door handle has dog feces stuck to it. 
After being utterly defeated by the monsters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:31.120
she requests the principal to let her&nbsp;
share the responsibility with someone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:36.640
However, the principal asks her to leave if she&nbsp;
cannot handle the pressure of being a teacher.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:42.640
That night, Zeki goes to the school’s gym to start&nbsp;
digging for his money. Meanwhile, at Lisi’s home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:48.320
her friend Caro fixes the printer that prints out&nbsp;
Lisi’s academic results. On looking up the details&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:53.680
of the print, they figure out that it was done&nbsp;
when Zeki was in the house and Lisi was passed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:59.840
out. Lisi suspects him of using her diploma to get&nbsp;
the job. She drives to the and checks his files in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:05.520
the principal’s office. On matching the results,&nbsp;
she realizes that her suspicion is true. Minutes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:11.600
later, she bumps into Zeki and calls him out for&nbsp;
using her diploma. He asks her to name her price&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:17.440
but Lisi doesn’t want any money, all she wants&nbsp;
is to get rid of her duty as 10 B’s teacher. 
&nbsp;

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:22.800
The next day, they request the principal to swap&nbsp;
their duties. Zeki steps into the classroom and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:27.680
comes across a male genital drawn on the board.&nbsp;
He tries to fetch something from the cupboard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:33.680
but accidentally sets his hands on mouse traps. As&nbsp;
he retreats, a slimy black substance drops on him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:37.840
and the students burst out laughing.&nbsp;
Still, he tries continuing the class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:44.160
but is stuck to the chair in the process. The&nbsp;
following day, Zeki arrives prepared with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:49.600
paintball gun. Some students are outside skipping&nbsp;
classes and refusing to come even when asked. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:54.960
hits them with the gun and gathers them all in the&nbsp;
class. He only wants them to stay quiet for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.960 --> 00:06:00.640
period and doesn’t care if they study or not.
When Lisi arrives to ask for chalk, she sees a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:06.560
student crying. She tells Zeki about it, to which&nbsp;
he asks the student to cry silently. Lisi realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:11.760
that he isn’t teaching them anything and is&nbsp;
getting paid for just sitting there. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:17.200
Zeki is kicked out of the strip club because of&nbsp;
accommodation difficulties. With nowhere to go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:23.440
he ends up at Lisi’s home. Lisi and Caro&nbsp;
mistake him for an intruder and beat him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:28.800
up before realizing who he actually is. He&nbsp;
stays the night at the house with Lisi, Caro,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:34.640
and Lisi’s younger sister Laura. The next morning,&nbsp;
Zeki begs Lisi to let him stay at their house for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:40.320
two weeks. Initially, she doesn’t want a fraud&nbsp;
like him around them but then, she gets an idea.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:46.160
She agrees to let him stay but only if he actually&nbsp;
teaches 10 B and not just hangs around with them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:51.120
Desperate for a place, Zeki accepts the offer. 
To help him teach, she gives him the reading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.920
material and the syllabus. Caro also&nbsp;
advises him to control the class’s leaders;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.920 --> 00:07:01.520
Daniel and Chantel. If the leaders respect&nbsp;
him, the others will automatically follow.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:06.000
Zeki reads the details about the leaders&nbsp;
and finds out they are micro criminals. 
&nbsp;

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:11.440
Later that day, Lisi and Zeki go to the strip club&nbsp;
to get dinner. Lisi tells him that Daniel of class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:17.040
10 B wants to be a drug dealer in the future,&nbsp;
which is the primary reason why he is uninterested&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:22.480
in studying. With this information, Zeki might be&nbsp;
able to help the students, even though he is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:27.840
in the least interested in doing so. That night&nbsp;
while digging through the gym, he finds a time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:34.320
capsule buried several years ago. On checking,&nbsp;
he discovers Lisi’s picture and a note inside. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:40.080
laughs at her note where she wishes she weren’t so&nbsp;
fat. Eventually, he falls asleep on his desk. 
&nbsp;

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:44.240
In the morning, the students take advantage of&nbsp;
his unconsciousness and give him a makeover.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.640
Lisi helps him in the toilet because he&nbsp;
feels sick. The care she shows for him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:54.320
is unlike anything Zeki has ever experienced.&nbsp;
He slowly but surely starts falling for her.
&nbsp;

00:07:54.320 --> 00:08:00.480
The following day, Zeki takes class 10 B&nbsp;
to an educational tour to a dealer’s house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:05.120
Daniel witnesses what the life of an actual&nbsp;
criminal looks like and decides to take a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:10.320
different career path. Zeki advises the students&nbsp;
to join Lisi’s theater class if they do not want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:16.080
to end up like the dealer. They do as told and&nbsp;
audition for a Romeo and Juliet play. Daniel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:22.000
auditions for the role of Romeo and does great.&nbsp;
However, Zeki thinks the drama is too boring. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:27.520
and the students collectively re-write the play&nbsp;
and make a modern and entertaining version. 
&nbsp;

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:32.000
A few more weeks go by in a similar fashion.&nbsp;
Zeki continues digging the tunnel through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:36.720
gymnasium. He and Lisi get along well and&nbsp;
the students have started to study instead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.520
of creating trouble all the time. One day,&nbsp;
the teacher’s ratings given by the students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:47.200
are released on the internet. Lisi is disappointed&nbsp;
because she doesn’t get selected for any category.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:52.240
To most of the teachers, it is just a silly game&nbsp;
but since Lisi wants her students to like her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.080
she feels extremely down.
To make her feel better, Zeki takes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:01.280
and the students to a station where they vandalize&nbsp;
a train. The students see the fun side of Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:07.920
for the first time and start to respect her. They&nbsp;
have to run away after almost being caught by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:13.840
police but Lisi enjoys the night nonetheless. The&nbsp;
next day, the students greet her in the hallway&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:19.200
and politely agree to do everything she says. 
Then, they go on a field trip to a farm for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:24.880
project. The children are playing around when they&nbsp;
accidentally hit her with a sex hormone that makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:30.960
her high. At the end of the day, Zeki has to carry&nbsp;
her home and calm her hormones down. Her younger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.760
sister Laura is worried because the people from&nbsp;
child services are going to be there any minute.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:40.640
If they see Lisi in such a condition, they might&nbsp;
reconsider letting Laura live with her. When Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:45.920
wakes up a while later, she sees Zeki and Laura&nbsp;
talking to the person from child services. Zeki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:53.600
pretends to be her caring boyfriend and kisses her&nbsp;
as an act. After the official leaves, Lisi asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:59.040
him what he wants in turn for the favor. To her&nbsp;
surprise, he replies that he did it for Laura. 
&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:03.360
That evening, Zeki finally finds the money&nbsp;
that he had been looking for. He goes through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:08.960
a rollercoaster of emotions and starts crying&nbsp;
tears of happiness. He then goes to the strip club&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:13.600
and pays off his debts. When asked where he&nbsp;
wants to go now, Zeki claims he has started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:19.440
to like his new life. On the day of the modern&nbsp;
Romeo and Juliet play, everyone is nervous. At&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:24.800
the end of the day, the play is a hit and gets&nbsp;
second place in the competition. The students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:29.200
are overjoyed because this is the first thing&nbsp;
they did as a group that was successful. 
&nbsp;

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.960
The following day at gym class, a student performs&nbsp;
a high jump and accidentally reveals the tunnel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:40.720
under the gymnasium. When Lisi goes down to check,&nbsp;
she overhears Zeki on the other side talking to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:46.640
someone on the phone. He reveals everything about&nbsp;
his true intentions of coming to school. Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:52.240
feels betrayed and used by him. She also learns&nbsp;
about his past as a criminal and threatens to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:57.840
call the police if he does not leave his job and&nbsp;
her home immediately. With no way to convince&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:03.280
her otherwise, Zeki agrees to go away. The next&nbsp;
day is the big test that the students have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:08.480
preparing for a long time. Before it starts, they&nbsp;
bring out different pictures and stare at them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:13.680
On being asked they reveal that Zeki had advised&nbsp;
them to bring a picture of what they love the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:19.760
to keep them motivated. A student informs Lisi&nbsp;
that Zeki's motivation photo is in his drawer.
&nbsp;

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:25.840
Curious, she checks it and finds a picture of&nbsp;
herself that he had found in the time capsule.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:31.440
Just then, Zeynep arrives with a letter that&nbsp;
Zeki left for Lisi. The letter says that he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:36.160
sorry for breaking her trust. He also explains&nbsp;
that he had decided to start a new life as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.960
teacher even after getting the money. 
Zeynep adds that Zeki is on his way to rob&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:46.640
a bank with a bad influence. If Lisi doesn’t&nbsp;
stop him, he might enter the crime world again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:51.440
Lisi immediately tries calling him but the call&nbsp;
goes straight to voicemail. She gets an idea to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:55.840
use a science project to communicate with him.&nbsp;
With the help of the students, the plan works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.840 --> 00:12:01.760
but Zeki's crime partner breaks the project. At&nbsp;
last, Zeki realizes he wants to continue living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:07.440
his life as a teacher and ditches the plan. 
Following that, he goes home with a gift for Lisi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:13.280
and asks her to be his prom date. She opens the&nbsp;
box and finds a beautiful dress inside. They meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:19.040
at the end of the stairs and kiss. At school, the&nbsp;
principal cries while checking 10 B’s test papers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:24.320
The progress they have shown is exemplary and all&nbsp;
credit goes to Zeki. She wants him to stay as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:30.160
permanent teacher but Zeki comes clean and tells&nbsp;
her he isn’t qualified. The principal doesn’t seem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:38.560
to care. She forges a high school diploma for him&nbsp;
and allows him to stay. At last, the couple joins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:42.960
everyone at the prom and enjoys it. 
